Legacy ChaCha/HChaCha attribution

The portable legacy importer implementation follows the ChaCha and HChaCha
reference implementation from floodyberry/chacha-opt:
https://github.com/floodyberry/chacha-opt

The upstream project declares its license as:

    Public Domain, or MIT

The historical YSM source snapshot did not record an exact upstream commit.
This implementation is retained only to reproduce the legacy file-format state
transitions and does not include the upstream runtime-selected assembly library.
